AArch64 AC+dmb.st+ldadd+ldadd
"Expected: Forbidden. Source: Coq memory/ARMBar.v, ARMBar.AtomicClause.ac_rmw_observer_forbidden. The observer is an RMW. UNVERIFIED -- run herd7"
{
0:X1=x; 0:X2=s;
1:X1=x; 1:X2=s;
}
 P0               | P1               ;
